00:04:17.930 --> 00:04:20.760
after to the coup that took over

00:04:20.760 --> 00:04:25.760
the government in February,
2021, and we felt lighter.

00:04:25.850 --> 00:04:28.040
There's an urgent need
for us to do something

00:04:28.040 --> 00:04:31.580
that make this specific issue visible

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:34.130
