00:04:34.130 --> 00:04:35.460
So, yeah.

00:04:35.460 --> 00:04:38.073
Let me just quickly share
my screen right now.

00:04:39.550 --> 00:04:42.683
Okay, Phuong Anh you can start
talking about the project.

00:04:44.321 --> 00:04:45.735
- So thank you Tam.

00:04:45.735 --> 00:04:49.430
So our project is an independent project,

00:04:49.430 --> 00:04:54.430
started out as a very personal
project to both me and Tam

00:04:55.570 --> 00:04:58.480
because we feel very strongly about

00:04:58.480 --> 00:05:00.390
what is happening in Myanmar

00:05:00.390 --> 00:05:05.390
and through our personal
encounters with the people

00:05:06.313 --> 00:05:11.313
who work on Myanmar and who is
currently living in Myanmar,

00:05:12.890 --> 00:05:15.470
we decided to start this project

00:05:15.470 --> 00:05:17.820
and our project is a nonprofit,

00:05:17.820 --> 00:05:19.890
independent and overarching project

00:05:19.890 --> 00:05:22.360
that highlights the extreme
violence in Myanmar,

00:05:22.360 --> 00:05:25.663
which is not been fully covered
by in international media.

00:05:27.860 --> 00:05:29.810
Can you move to that next slide please.

