00:06:41.160 --> 00:06:44.550
as well as who have helped us
to promote the Zine as well.

00:06:44.550 --> 00:06:45.383
Thank you.

00:06:46.660 --> 00:06:51.660
So for, as I shared a bit before,

00:06:52.540 --> 00:06:55.040
the reason why we started this project

00:06:55.040 --> 00:06:57.950
is because we felt intrigued

00:06:57.950 --> 00:07:01.150
by the recent youth resistant
campaigns in Myanmar

00:07:01.150 --> 00:07:03.260
since the February coup.

00:07:03.260 --> 00:07:07.231
And we are just a group of
undergraduates and artists

00:07:07.231 --> 00:07:12.170
with support from the students
from Yangon University.

00:07:12.170 --> 00:07:16.900
And we decided to initiate
a multimedia project

00:07:16.900 --> 00:07:19.350
that centers around a hybrid artistic,

00:07:19.350 --> 00:07:21.610
non scholarly Zine publication.

00:07:21.610 --> 00:07:23.540
This project is meant to direct attention

00:07:23.540 --> 00:07:26.360
to the current political
turmoil, of course,

00:07:26.360 --> 00:07:30.670
Myanmar with the Southeast
Asia at this targeted audience.

00:07:30.670 --> 00:07:34.683
And that's it, we intend
to collect stories

00:07:39.130 --> 00:07:41.617
and perspective from people of Myanmar

00:07:41.617 --> 00:07:44.440
who are living on this
escalating violence,

00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:48.990
as well as we want to
include international

00:07:48.990 --> 00:07:50.750
and regional stances in responses

00:07:50.750 --> 00:07:53.550
to the humanitarian crisis as well.

00:07:53.550 --> 00:07:58.550
If we have access to the resources

00:07:59.770 --> 00:08:01.700
and all of these will be communicated

00:08:01.700 --> 00:08:04.010
through a multimedia project

00:08:04.010 --> 00:08:07.270
consisting of a series
of events and activities

00:08:07.270 --> 00:08:09.053
centered around Zine publication.

00:08:11.438 --> 00:08:16.080
So we have received a lot of support

00:08:16.080 --> 00:08:19.440
from our organizations from Fulbright

00:08:19.440 --> 00:08:24.440
and as well as from students
from University of Yangon

00:08:25.470 --> 00:08:29.220
and we believe that in the possibility

00:08:29.220 --> 00:08:31.290
and long term impact of this project

00:08:31.290 --> 00:08:36.290
as to surface and highlight
the voices of the people

00:08:37.740 --> 00:08:40.880
living in post school Myanmar.

00:08:40.880 --> 00:08:44.460
So from Fulbright, we have
Fulbright Historical Society,

00:08:44.460 --> 00:08:47.240
an undergraduate community
