00:09:03.900 --> 00:09:06.320
And we have Fulbright Art Lab,

00:09:06.320 --> 00:09:07.930
a student run organization

00:09:07.930 --> 00:09:12.160
based in Fulbright University,
Vietnam founded in 2018.

00:09:12.160 --> 00:09:16.010
And Art Lab has coordinated
numerous events and programs

00:09:16.010 --> 00:09:19.330
such as film screening, panel discussions,

00:09:19.330 --> 00:09:21.970
exhibitions, aiming to create a connection

00:09:21.970 --> 00:09:24.293
between art labors and
communities in Vietnam.

00:09:26.150 --> 00:09:29.110
And we receive a lot of support

00:09:29.110 --> 00:09:32.783
