00:17:24.170 --> 00:17:29.090
like I feel very deeply for
what is happening there,

00:17:29.090 --> 00:17:32.420
but I couldn't comprehend like
how such thing could happen

00:17:34.179 --> 00:17:37.840
for, in a place that's so near to me.

00:17:37.840 --> 00:17:40.440
And right after the course,

00:17:40.440 --> 00:17:45.080
