So why Zine?

00:19:50.170 --> 00:19:51.030
Why?

00:19:51.030 --> 00:19:53.940
So I don't think people
would be very familiar

00:19:53.940 --> 00:19:56.810
with but this very specific
type of publication,

00:19:56.810 --> 00:19:58.970
