01:10:18.180 --> 01:10:21.740
So I can also be revoked my citizenship.

01:10:21.740 --> 01:10:26.740
And then they also cease
and raided their homes

01:10:27.030 --> 01:10:29.663
and yeah, the confiscated their homes

01:10:29.663 --> 01:10:31.350
and the publishing houses,

01:10:31.350 --> 01:10:34.200
that's kind of the atrocities is going on.

01:10:34.200 --> 01:10:39.020
That's why the situation,
this kind of situation.

01:10:39.020 --> 01:10:41.510
I do hope to be shared.

01:10:41.510 --> 01:10:45.130
And also the arbitrary arrest

01:10:45.130 --> 01:10:47.300
is not just limited to the adult,

01:10:47.300 --> 01:10:50.250
but also to the
kindergarten kids, you know,

01:10:50.250 --> 01:10:52.850
if they cannot arrest the parents,

01:10:52.850 --> 01:10:57.850
they simply arrest three years
old kids something like that.

01:10:58.670 --> 01:11:03.340
So this kind of very big atrocities

01:11:03.340 --> 01:11:07.360
would be published I do hope.

01:11:07.360 --> 01:11:08.960
Yeah, thank you so much.

01:11:11.240 --> 01:11:12.073
