greater than, you know,

01:11:27.690 --> 01:11:30.880
even though we may put
some labor into something,

01:11:30.880 --> 01:11:34.253
the risks on the ground and
basic questions of livelihood

01:11:34.253 --> 01:11:37.037
and how we can come up with technologies

01:11:37.037 --> 01:11:40.590
to transfer some of those necessities

01:11:40.590 --> 01:11:44.740
at the same time as making
the knowledge available

01:11:44.740 --> 01:11:45.573
