where people discuss this

01:22:40.630 --> 01:22:43.490
is the gray zone of the revolution.

01:22:47.300 --> 01:22:52.300
They are, so we have
always see the revolution

01:22:52.580 --> 01:22:56.240
as something very binary between
the military and the people

01:22:56.240 --> 01:22:58.840
and between the military and the CDM.

01:22:58.840 --> 01:23:03.840
But there are like also soldiers
defectors from the military

01:23:07.170 --> 01:23:10.620
trying to join the CDM as
you all may have known.

01:23:18.657 --> 01:23:22.090
The military Hunta has
a very separate system

01:23:25.532 --> 01:23:30.532
in alongside the civilian
government system in Myanmar.

01:23:30.630 --> 01:23:33.440
That's why they sustain
until the present day.

01:23:33.440 --> 01:23:36.180
And they are defectors,

01:23:36.180 --> 01:23:41.180
soldier defectors calling
for help from Myanmar

01:23:42.630 --> 01:23:46.940
who want to defect the military
Hunta, but they have family

01:23:46.940 --> 01:23:51.320
and they have other strengths
attached to Tatmadaw

01:23:52.340 --> 01:23:55.450
that they haven't been able to.

01:23:55.450 --> 01:23:59.650
And they have not received as much helped

01:23:59.650 --> 01:24:02.443
from the international
community as the CDM

01:24:08.356 --> 01:24:12.783
and the civilians, when it
comes to doing the revolution.

01:24:15.350 --> 01:24:18.960
I personally consider
them as like the gray zone

01:24:18.960 --> 01:24:20.780
of the revolution.

